menu "GBX app"

config GBX_LIBRARY_ENTRIES
    int "ROM library: files and folders"
    range 256 4096
    default 4096
    help
        The entries of the ROM list, files and folders under roms/, in
        PSRAM; a card with more stops the scan there. A board with little
        PSRAM sets less in boards/<board>/sdkconfig.defaults.

config GBX_LIBRARY_NAMES_KB
    int "ROM library: pool of names, KiB"
    range 32 512
    default 512
    help
        The names of the ROM list's entries, in PSRAM; a card whose names
        take more stops the scan there. A board with little PSRAM sets less
        in boards/<board>/sdkconfig.defaults.

endmenu
